2,"Full text of ""enwiki-Katla_language-20200726.pdf""",https://archive.org/stream/enwiki-Katla_language-20200726.pdf/enwiki-Katla_language-20200726_djvu.txt,"Katla (also Kaalak or Kwaalak ) is a Katla language, closely related to a neighbouring language called Tima but otherwise quite divergent within the Niger-Congo family. The variety Julud is mutually intelligible with Katla-Kulharong but not with Katla-Cakom.",Katla,Niger-Congo
